sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (Onboarding / Product Catalog)
    participant S as Vercel Function<br/>POST /api/ai/catalog-schema
    participant C as CreditSystem
    participant R as Unified AI Router
    participant DS as DeepSeek (primary)
    participant GM as Gemini (fallback)

    U->>S: businessRequirements
    S->>C: getWallet (create if new)
    S->>C: reserveCredits (maxCost)
    C-->>S: reserved

    S->>R: routeAIRequest(engine=velcora-chat)
    R->>DS: chat/completions (16s budget)
    alt DeepSeek answers
        DS-->>R: JSON schema
    else slow / 429 / 5xx / timeout
        R->>GM: generateContent (16s budget)
        GM-->>R: JSON schema
    end
    R-->>S: NormalizedResponse

    alt valid JSON schema
        S->>S: sanitize + guarantee name/price anchors
        S->>C: settleCredits (once — never double-charged)
        S-->>U: { schema, provider, creditsUsed }
        U->>U: BusinessProfile.catalogSchema<br/>DynamicCatalogFields renders fields
    else unusable / deadline
        S->>C: refundReservation (0 credits charged)
        S-->>U: neutral schema + degraded flag
    end
